```Rule: Password spraying | MITRE T1110.003 | Python rule: password_spraying```
```Logic: one source IP fails against >= 5 DIFFERENT usernames inside 10 minutes (grouped by IP, not user, because each account sees only one failure)```
index=linux sourcetype=linux_secure ("Failed password" OR "Invalid user")
| rex "(Failed password for (invalid user )?|Invalid user )(?<user>\S+) from (?<src_ip>\d{1,3}(\.\d{1,3}){3})"
| sort 0 _time
| streamstats time_window=10m dc(user) AS distinct_users_10m BY src_ip
| where distinct_users_10m >= 5
| stats max(distinct_users_10m) AS distinct_users values(user) AS users min(_time) AS first_seen max(_time) AS last_seen BY src_ip host
| convert ctime(first_seen) ctime(last_seen)
